{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rescue princesses, others save the whole world. But here, you save your\u00a0rumbling stomach<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/extras/fc0e1caca4600cb3f9e8ecff6fce6fa8.poster.avif?t=1768777219\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/extras/fc0e1caca4600cb3f9e8ecff6fce6fa8.webm?t=1768777219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/extras/fc0e1caca4600cb3f9e8ecff6fce6fa8.mp4?t=1768777219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>So don\u2019t wait until hunger takes over. Embark on a quirky journey full of adventures, unexpected encounters, platforming challenges, and a fun combination mechanic. Explore a world packed with mysteries, eccentric characters, and bizarre problems. Dig, swing, and sprint through a lovingly crafted world where surprises await you around every corner!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/extras/6671aec91d53e3fdc28cb4af3844045f.poster.avif?t=1768777219\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/extras/6671aec91d53e3fdc28cb4af3844045f.webm?t=1768777219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/extras/6671aec91d53e3fdc28cb4af3844045f.mp4?t=1768777219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>  </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Schl\u00e4nd</strong>\u00a0- a compact but densely filled land brimming with exciting discoveries and adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet and help the locals</strong> - from clueless cats and helpless creatures to a potential lover: they\u2019re all counting on you in their challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge and create</strong> - creatively merge items to overcome obstacles and craft brand-new tools</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your tools </strong>- dig up hidden treasures with your shovel, uncover secret spots with the grappling hook, or dash through Schl\u00e4nd at lightning speed with your running shoes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create the PERFECT schnitzel</strong>\u00a0- if you do everything just right, you\u2019ll be rewarded with a irresistible schnitzel from Schnitzelville\u2019s very own chef!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/extras/e8561b373d1fda4ea1d11066de456c59.poster.avif?t=1768777219\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/extras/e8561b373d1fda4ea1d11066de456c59.webm?t=1768777219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/extras/e8561b373d1fda4ea1d11066de456c59.mp4?t=1768777219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/extras/16a7657736e3787e25832982686d6a89.poster.avif?t=1768777219\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/extras/16a7657736e3787e25832982686d6a89.webm?t=1768777219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/extras/16a7657736e3787e25832982686d6a89.mp4?t=1768777219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3064060?t=1768777219","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768777219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/a66b10d5884c80c13e8dc71c06640aa92cbb59c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768777219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/a66b10d5884c80c13e8dc71c06640aa92cbb59c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768777219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rescue princesses, others save the whole world. But here, you save your\u00a0rumbling stomach<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/extras/fc0e1caca4600cb3f9e8ecff6fce6fa8.poster.avif?t=1768777219\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/extras/fc0e1caca4600cb3f9e8ecff6fce6fa8.webm?t=1768777219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064060/extras/fc0e1caca4600cb3f9e8ecff6fce6fa8.mp4?t=1768777219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>So don\u2019t wait until hunger takes over. Embark on a quirky journey full of adventures, unexpected encounters, platforming challenges, and a fun combination mechanic. Explore a world packed with mysteries, eccentric characters, and bizarre problems. Dig, swing, and sprint through a lovingly crafted world where surprises await you around every cor